# Fuel tank: adds fuel storage to its cabled grid ("Fuel tank capacity" tweak). Its fuel lives on
# the structure — destroying it loses the stored fuel. Cone = fuel iconography (fuel nodes are
# cones). Spawned origin 1.4 above ground.
Prefab gameFuelTank
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer wireshapes
		Node Cone
		Type StaticMesh
		Scale 1 1.4 1
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 0.8 1.4 0.8
